===Etymology===
From earlier *parma; probably [[onomatopoeia]]. Cognates include Estonian {{term|parm|lang=et}}, Votic {{term|paarma|lang=vot}}, Livonian {{term|pārmaz}}, and Mari {{term|pormo}}.<ref>{{cite book | last = Häkkinen | first = Kaisa | year = 2004 | title = Nykysuomen etymologinen sanakirja | publisher = WSOY | id = ISBN 951-0-27108-X }}</ref>

